+
+### B3 evidence
+
+Positive control before the claim:
+
+| | fault absent | fault present |
+|---|---|---|
+| pre-fix | 215 results | **111 results + 1 panic** (104 tests never ran) |
+| post-fix | 215 results | 215 results, 0 panics |
+
